%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: nested bookmarks. A chapter with a count of two is followed
% by its two children, all pointing at the page under construction,
% page 1. The .ir golden lists the three outline entries; the .pdf
% golden holds the outline tree with the chapter open, its children
% linked as siblings, and every item's destination the first page.
[ /Title (Chapter) /Count 2 /OUT pdfmark
[ /Title (First) /Count 0 /OUT pdfmark
[ /Title (Second) /Count 0 /OUT pdfmark
72 700 moveto 300 700 lineto stroke
showpage
